 "notes": "Official outcomes a to c are tested; d is an attitude. Sides are whole numbers from Pythagorean triples (3, 4, 5; 5, 12, 13; 8, 15, 17 and their multiples) so every root is exact. Grade 7 meets the relationship for the first time: the prerequisites are squares, roots and right angles.",
